    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/356a97f8cf11e6e0496057137099e7db.poster.avif?t=1753014712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/356a97f8cf11e6e0496057137099e7db.webm?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/356a97f8cf11e6e0496057137099e7db.mp4?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Control different insects in an <strong>open world</strong> environment and learn about their way of life.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/136d0fbc065148052b8ae7bff1e6a773.poster.avif?t=1753014712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/136d0fbc065148052b8ae7bff1e6a773.webm?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/136d0fbc065148052b8ae7bff1e6a773.mp4?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Explore</strong> worlds like the European forest, desert landscapes or human habitats like apartments and houses.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/2b16a01ec57ca5db551b0102f08230e1.poster.avif?t=1753014712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/2b16a01ec57ca5db551b0102f08230e1.webm?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/2b16a01ec57ca5db551b0102f08230e1.mp4?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/1a72648f24a660204c7ef377cc62b2c0.avif?t=1753014712\" /></div><br><strong>Collect</strong> resources, other insects and upgrade player cards.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/bd091245ab0eb76db5ee17aa5125e28d.poster.avif?t=1753014712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/bd091245ab0eb76db5ee17aa5125e28d.webm?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/bd091245ab0eb76db5ee17aa5125e28d.mp4?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Improve</strong> your insects with <strong>upgrade cards</strong> like the honeydew or caffeinated leaves<br>and level your insect using the resources that unlock Metamorphosis levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/8ae01b3086b076ffa355cc0644f636db.poster.avif?t=1753014712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/8ae01b3086b076ffa355cc0644f636db.webm?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/8ae01b3086b076ffa355cc0644f636db.mp4?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Learn</strong> about many different <strong>mini-games</strong> during the open world exploration, including:<br>- Anthill fights<br>- Obstacle course<br>- Insect race against time (on foot or in flight mode)<br>- or arena fights in 1 versus 1 style.<br>- Multiplayer Strategy mode<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/8d49dd8ae7389dd14ffa65edcddc57db.poster.avif?t=1753014712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/8d49dd8ae7389dd14ffa65edcddc57db.webm?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/8d49dd8ae7389dd14ffa65edcddc57db.mp4?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Complete various <strong>learning quests</strong> and fight other insects in single player mode or against your friends in multiplayer mode.<br><br><strong>Multiplayer Splitscreen Support:</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/4880248c88562c3f1a0017fb4deb74bf.poster.avif?t=1753014712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/4880248c88562c3f1a0017fb4deb74bf.webm?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/4880248c88562c3f1a0017fb4deb74bf.mp4?t=1753014712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/db3786db17828b31d05825d59f9c6be6.avif?t=1753014712\" /></div><br><br>Almost all insects have been professionally scanned and can be viewed in the game lexicon, including all information.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1008340/extras/cb0eed2d1a0f96e29a1218e7ab704220.p